+// DCS Control (0099): the foveated single layer.
+//
+// Under `[ofxr] foveated_layers` the application (Quad Views' two-layer mode)
+// hands over a periphery and a focus projection layer per eye, and the layer
+// synthesizes each on its own. Handed to the runtime as two layers, the runtime
